'''Black & White''' (ブラック＆ホワイト, ''Burakku ando Howaito'', '''Black & White''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 5.8 Update|Version 5.8]].

==Effect==
Worker Cat Max UP (Sm): Wallet size is increased by 10%.

